    "chunk_text": "Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere Cristes bec hw\u00e6t Leofric biscop h\u00e6f\u00f0 gedon innto sancte Petres minstre on \u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6f\u00f0 geinnod \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6r geutod w\u00e6s \u00feurh Godes fultum & \u00feurh his forespr\u00e6ce & \u00feurh his \u00d0onne ys \u00feis se eaca on landum \u00fee he h\u00e6f\u00f0 of his agenum \u00fe\u00e6t mynster mid gegodod for his hlaforda & he ne funde \u00fea he to \u00feam mynstre feng nan mare landes \u00fee \u00f0ider ynn gewylde w\u00e6re \u00feonne twa hida \u00d0onne ys \u00feis seo oncnawenn is \u00fee he h\u00e6f\u00f0 God mid gecnawen & sanctum Petrum into \u00feam halgan \u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00feider ynn gedon ii biscop roda & II mycele gebonede roda butan o\u00f0rum litlum And III canterc\u00e6ppa & III canterstafas & V p\u00e6llene weofodsceatas & VII oferbr\u00e6delsas & II t\u00e6ppedu And II mycele gebonede candelsticcan & VI l\u00e6ssan candelsticcan gebonede & I silfren storcylle mid And nu \u00fe\u00e6r sind XVI upphangene & XII handbella & II fulle m\u00e6ssebec & I collectaneum & II And II salteras & se \u00feriddan saltere swa man sing\u00f0 on rome & II ymneras & I deorwyr\u00f0e bletsingboc & And martyrlogium & I canon on leden & I scriftboc on englisc & I full spelboc wintres & sumeres & & he ne funde on \u00feam mynstre \u00fea he tofeng boca na ma buton ane capitularie & I forealdodne nihtsang & \u00feus fela leden boca he beget innto \u00feam mynstre, liber pastoralis & liber dialogorum & libri IIII & ofer",
